   178     * changes to the registry are infrequent and hence getting just the 
delta will be much more
   179     * efficient than getting the complete registry.
   180     *
   181     * <p>Since the delta information is cached over a period of time, the
requests may return the
   182     * same data multiple times within the window configured by {@link
   183     * EurekaServerConfig#getRetentionTimeInMSInDeltaQueue()}.The clients 
